The leading eigenvector for χ_P is essentially the unweighted Gauss-Kuzmin density (overlap 0.9985). This means the arithmetic content lives entirely in the eigenvalue. Let me derive the exact analytical form: λ_0^h ≈ Σ_n h(n) · a_n where a_n is a closed-form sequence with Σ a_n = 1.
